Description: PipeWire Audio Control Center — DAW Companion for Linux
 A professional Linux desktop application for controlling and monitoring
 PipeWire, designed for DAW and audio-production workflows. Features
 include device management, sample rate and quantum control, real-time
 level metering, LUFS metering, latency measurement, and named
 configuration presets.
